    "No fasted-state-specific F, solubility, or dissolution data for the query itself; L4 solubility values are for close analogs and mostly buffer/FaSSIF/duodenal media.",
    "Low solubility of the close analogs may limit fasted absorption, but no quantitative link to F<20 is established.",
    "First-pass/clearance and gut-wall efflux/metabolism data for the query are not yet available at this level.",
